  unitName: Death Magress
  unitId: 60014
  unitNumber: 24
  description: A former knight from the utterly devastated Bariura Empire, he wielded
    a giant lance as one of the Six Heroes. He headed to the capital once he found
    out who had killed his parents in fear of his power. However, the war with the
    gods soon began. He killed countless gods on his way to face the emperor, earning
    him even more praise. It is, however, yet unknown as to whether or not he got
    his revenge.
  summonDesc: I'm one with the dark.<br>I am the knight in the shadows.<br>Summoner!
    Seek the dark with me!
  fusionDesc: My rage has become my strength.<br>Power of darkness, rain on me!
  evoDesc: The world is a dark place.<br>Even as time passes, this<br>does not change.
  element: 6
  rarity: 4
